---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import DotField from '../components/DotField.astro';
import { topics } from '../data/site';
---
<Layout title="关于本站">
  <article class="wrap">
    <header class="page-head">
      <span class="mono">ABOUT / 关于</span>
      <h1>保持观察，<br/>认真记录。</h1>
    </header>
    <div class="sec">
      <div class="sec-head"><div class="about-art"><DotField/></div></div>
      <div class="sec-body about-copy">
        <p>这里是机场巡查博客，域名为 jichangxuncha.blog。本站将围绕机场推荐、VPS与第三方订阅使用方法持续更新。</p>
        <p>目前处于框架搭建阶段。文中示例用于展示栏目结构，后续会逐步补充真实评测、测试环境和更新时间。</p>
        <ul>
          {topics.map((t) => <li><a href={`/category/${t.slug}/`}><span class="mono">{t.no}</span>{t.category}<i aria-hidden="true">→</i></a></li>)}
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </article>
</Layout>
<style>
  .about-art{max-width:280px}
  .about-copy{max-width:42em}
  .about-copy p{font-size:clamp(17px,1.5vw,19px);line-height:1.9;margin-bottom:1em}
  .about-copy ul{margin-top:32px;border-top:1px solid var(--ink)}
  .about-copy li{border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}
  .about-copy a{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:20px;min-height:60px;font:500 18px var(--head);transition:color .15s}
  .about-copy a .mono{color:var(--muted)}
  .about-copy a:hover{color:var(--accent)}
  .about-copy i{margin-left:auto;font-style:normal}
</style>
